{
  "atlas": {"height":1024,"high_contrast":"motion_hc.webp","normal":"motion.webp","width":1024},
  "curves": {"about":"Every interface motion's times and easing (report.md step 8 and section 10.3). Rules from §21.8 (D3 (b)): every step lasts 150 to 250 ms and eases out, nothing overshoots its end value, a press squashes slightly, rewards fly into their counter, shake is never above 4 px. From §20.8: each motion names its reduced form, which drops swoops and particles but keeps one coin landing in its counter, and nothing repeats faster than three times a second. Times are in milliseconds from the motion's start; distances in points (the kit's UI.px turns them into pixels); sprites are pieces of client/ui/art/motion.json. check_curves.py holds this file to these rules.","easings":{"cubic_out":{"formula":"1 - (1 - t)^3","godot":{"ease":"EASE_OUT","trans":"TRANS_CUBIC"},"overshoot":false}},"motions":{"press":{"about":"A button pressed and let go: on touch-down its body sinks travel_points onto its lip (rubric quality 4: 2 to 4 points), squashes slightly and darkens, with a light haptic tap (§21.8); on release it comes back. Nothing grows past its rest size.","full":{"down":[{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":0,"ms":150,"name":"sink","property":"travel_points","to":3},{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":1,"ms":150,"name":"squash","property":"scale","to":0.96},{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":1,"ms":150,"name":"darken","property":"self_modulate_value","to":0.9}],"up":[{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":3,"ms":180,"name":"rise","property":"travel_points","to":0},{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":0.96,"ms":180,"name":"recover","property":"scale","to":1},{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":0.9,"ms":180,"name":"lighten","property":"self_modulate_value","to":1}]},"haptic":"light","reduced":{"down":[{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":0,"ms":150,"name":"sink","property":"travel_points","to":3},{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":1,"ms":150,"name":"darken","property":"self_modulate_value","to":0.88}],"form":"Sinks and darkens, no squash.","up":[{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":3,"ms":150,"name":"rise","property":"travel_points","to":0},{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":0.88,"ms":150,"name":"lighten","property":"self_modulate_value","to":1}]}},"reward":{"about":"The result screen's reward sequence (rubric quality 5). The prize gathers and charges for the tier's anticipation_ms (0.3 to 1 s, longer for a rarer reward): gather starts it, the prize holds, and charge, marked ends_at burst, is placed to end at the burst (it starts its ms before); the payoff starts at the burst (its at_ms count from there): the burst, the reveal, and the coins flying in arcs to their counter, 60 ms apart. Each coin's landing runs on_landing: the counter rolls up by that coin's share and pulses. The pulse changes size, never brightness, so the landings are not flashes (§20.8); the burst is the one flash of a reward. The coins share one sprite strip (face, turn, edge, turn) at frame_ms a frame: a coin turning, at constant brightness. A rarer reward has more particles, a longer anticipation and a brighter, larger burst (tiers). Values named tier.<key> come from the reward's tier.","full":{"anticipation":[{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":1,"ms":250,"name":"gather","property":"scale","target":"prize","to":0.94},{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","ends_at":"burst","from":1,"ms":250,"name":"charge","property":"self_modulate_value","target":"prize","to":1.3}],"high_contrast":"The same steps with each sprite's _hc twin from motion_hc.webp.","on_landing":[{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":"shown","ms":150,"name":"counter_roll","property":"value","target":"counter","to":"shown + this coin's share"},{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":1,"ms":150,"name":"counter_pulse_up","property":"scale","restart":"from the current scale","target":"counter","to":1.06},{"at_ms":150,"easing":"cubic_out","from":1.06,"ms":150,"name":"counter_pulse_down","property":"scale","target":"counter","to":1}],"payoff":[{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":0.4,"ms":220,"name":"burst_rays","property":"scale","sprite":"burst__rays__normal","target":"burst","to":"tier.burst_scale"},{"at_ms":100,"easing":"cubic_out","from":"tier.burst_value","ms":250,"name":"burst_rays_fade","property":"alpha","sprite":"burst__rays__normal","target":"burst","to":0},{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":0.3,"ms":200,"name":"burst_ring","property":"scale","sprite":"burst__ring__normal","target":"burst","to":"tier.burst_scale"},{"at_ms":50,"easing":"cubic_out","from":"tier.burst_value","ms":200,"name":"burst_ring_fade","property":"alpha","sprite":"burst__ring__normal","target":"burst","to":0},{"at_ms":0,"count":"tier.sparkles","easing":"cubic_out","from":0,"ms":250,"name":"sparkles","property":"offset_points","sprite":"sparkle__star__normal","stagger_ms":30,"target":"burst","to":34},{"at_ms":100,"count":"tier.sparkles","easing":"cubic_out","from":1,"ms":200,"name":"sparkles_fade","property":"alpha","sprite":"sparkle__star__normal","stagger_ms":30,"target":"burst","to":0},{"at_ms":20,"count":"tier.dust","easing":"cubic_out","from":0,"ms":220,"name":"dust","property":"offset_points","sprite":"sparkle__dot__normal","stagger_ms":30,"target":"burst","to":24},{"at_ms":90,"count":"tier.dust","easing":"cubic_out","from":1,"ms":150,"name":"dust_fade","property":"alpha","sprite":"sparkle__dot__normal","stagger_ms":30,"target":"burst","to":0},{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":1.3,"ms":200,"name":"unglow","property":"self_modulate_value","target":"prize","to":1},{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":0.94,"ms":200,"name":"reveal_scale","property":"scale","target":"prize","to":1},{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":10,"ms":220,"name":"reveal_rise","property":"offset_points","target":"prize","to":0},{"arc_points":44,"at_ms":250,"count":"coins, at most 8","easing":"cubic_out","frame_ms":62,"from":"prize","ms":250,"name":"coins_fly","property":"arc","sprites":["coin__face__normal","coin__turn__normal","coin__edge__normal","coin__turn__normal"],"stagger_ms":60,"target":"coin","to":"counter"},{"at_ms":250,"count":"coins, at most 8","easing":"cubic_out","from":1,"ms":250,"name":"coins_shrink","property":"scale","stagger_ms":60,"target":"coin","to":0.7}],"tiers":{"common":{"anticipation_ms":300,"burst_scale":0.85,"burst_value":0.85,"dust":6,"sparkles":4},"epic":{"anticipation_ms":700,"burst_scale":1.15,"burst_value":1.25,"dust":12,"sparkles":10},"rare":{"anticipation_ms":450,"burst_scale":1,"burst_value":1,"dust":8,"sparkles":6}}},"reduced":{"form":"No anticipation or burst. The prize cross-fades in, one coin lands in its counter (the one particle §20.8 keeps), and the counter shows its new value at once.","steps":[{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":0,"ms":150,"name":"reveal_fade","property":"alpha","target":"prize","to":1},{"at_ms":150,"count":1,"easing":"cubic_out","from":-10,"ms":200,"name":"coin_land","property":"offset_points","sprite":"coin__face__normal","target":"coin","to":0},{"at_ms":200,"count":1,"easing":"cubic_out","from":1,"ms":150,"name":"coin_land_fade","property":"alpha","sprite":"coin__face__normal","target":"coin","to":0},{"at_ms":350,"easing":"none","from":"old","ms":0,"name":"counter_set","property":"value","target":"counter","to":"new"}]}},"screen":{"about":"A screen change: the old screen fades out, the new one fades in from 0.985 of its size.","full":{"in":[{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":0,"ms":180,"name":"fade_in","property":"alpha","target":"new_screen","to":1},{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":0.985,"ms":180,"name":"grow","property":"scale","target":"new_screen","to":1}],"out":[{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":1,"ms":160,"name":"fade_out","property":"alpha","target":"old_screen","to":0}]},"reduced":{"form":"A cross-fade.","in":[{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":0,"ms":150,"name":"fade_in","property":"alpha","target":"new_screen","to":1}]}},"shine":{"about":"An idle shine on primary buttons (rubric quality 7): a soft band sweeps across the face once every period_ms, after a first wait, only while the button is enabled and idle. The period is the bob's (tokens bob_ms), so the shine keeps step with the idle bob; once in 2.4 s is far below §20.8's three times a second. Not drawn in high contrast: the band would blur the outline that mode keeps.","full":{"first_wait_ms":800,"high_contrast":"none","period_ms":2400,"steps":[{"at_ms":0,"easing":"cubic_out","from":-0.3,"ms":250,"name":"sweep","property":"x_fraction","sprite":"shine__sweep__normal","target":"button","to":1.3},{"at_ms":100,"easing":"cubic_out","from":0.6,"ms":150,"name":"sweep_fade","property":"alpha","sprite":"shine__sweep__normal","target":"button","to":0}]},"reduced":{"form":"None.","steps":[]}}},"rules":{"easings":["cubic_out"],"flash_hz_most":3,"longest_ms":250,"overshoot":false,"shake_px_most":4,"shake_switchable":true,"shortest_ms":150},"version":1},
